{"title":"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Annie (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />), Bogdan (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />), Cao (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />), Daniel (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />), and Emily (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />) are running for student government positions. Their campaign posters are printed by different printing companies. The graph below plots each student’s total price of their first batch of posters versus the number of posters in their first batch.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(put graph on problem 1 page)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1d&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1d (page does not exist)\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1d</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012714\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 855/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.989      1 Template:Image_needed\n100.00%    5.989      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35549:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012714 and revision id 277895. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}